  "description": "LORYEZ crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C78 H82 N12 O26 Yb6,2(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 7 O neighbors; Yb2 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb3 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb1B (Yb) has 7 O neighbors; Yb2B (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb3B (Yb) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a chain with approximately linear metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.512-3.749 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 97.35-114.08°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C80H90N12O28Yb6.",
